s the source in the style to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which it is added."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"identifier"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A URL to a TileJSON configuration file describing the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"source’s contents and other metadata."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"configurationURL"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The width and height (measured in points) of each tiled image"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the raster tile source. See the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTileSourceOptionTileSize","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"documentation for details."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"tileSize"}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An initialized raster tile source."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"After initializing and configuring the source, add it to a map view’s style"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"using the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNStyle\/addSource:","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" method."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The URL may be a full HTTP or HTTPS URL or, canonical URL. The URL should"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"point to a JSON file that conforms to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TileJSON specification"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Returns a raster tile source initialized with an identifier, configuration URL,"},{"type":"text","text":"